  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative Force is a funding programme for international projects for OECD-DAC countries in the MENA-region. It is open to Swedish organisations and their partners in our target countries who work through media or the arts to strengthen democracy, human rights and freedom of expression. Countries included are: Algeriga, Egypt, Iraq, Iran, Yemen, Jordan, Lebanon, Libya, Morocco, Palestine, Syria, Tunisia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Creative Force &#xe4;r ett program f&#xf6;r OECD/DAC-l&#xe4;nder i MENA-regionen som finansierar internationella projekt som genom kultur eller media arbetar f&#xf6;r att &#xe5;stadkomma positiv f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring i l&#xe4;nder d&#xe4;r demokrati, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och yttrandefrihet brister. L&#xe4;nder som inkluderas &#xe4;r: Algeriet, Egypten, Irak, Iran, Jemen, Jordanien, Libanon, Libyen, Marocko, Palestina, Syrien, Tunisien</narrative>
  </description>
